    "MenoMap Pro is active": {
      "localizations": {}
    },
    "MenoMap can show your surges before and after you started, as a coincidence check. Whether a treatment is right for you is a question for your clinician.": {
      "localizations": {}
    },
    "MenoMap cannot tell you to start, stop, or change a medicine. Bring your list to a clinician.": {
